hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"624","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kartey they jabke Aap namaz mein hotey aur Aap hamein jawaab detey. Phir jab ham Najaashi key paas se wapas aey to ham ne Aap ko salaam kya aur Aap ne hamein jawaab na diya. Aur farmaya: Beshak namaz mein mashghooliyat hai. (Bukhari: 1199)"
"625","[AI-translation] Aur Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein se koi namaz mein apne saathi se baat karta tha yahan tak ke naazil hui: (Namazon ki aur darmiyaani namaz ki hifaazat karo aur Allah key liye farmabardaar khadey ho). To hamein khaamosh rehney ka hukm diya gaya. (Bukhari: 1200)"
"626","[AI-translation] Muaaiqib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us aadmi key baarey mein farmaya jo mitti baraabar karta hai jahaan wo sajda karta hai. Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum karney waley ho to aik (martaba). (Bukhari: 1207)"
"627","[AI-translation] Abu Barza Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne aik din ghazwe mein namaz padhi jabke unki sawaari ki lagaam unkey haath mein thi. To sawaari unhey kheenchney lagi aur wo uskey peechey chalney lagey. To un se uskey baarey mein kaha gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chhe ya saat ya aath ghazwaat kiye hain. Aur main ne Aapki aasaani dekhi hai. Aur beshak main agar apni sawaari key sath wapas aaun to mujhey zyada mehboob hai is se ke main use chhor dun ke wo apne thikaaney ki taraf wapas jaey aur mujh par mushakkat ho. (Bukhari: 1211)"
"628","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne gehan ki hadees zikr ki. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya uskey qaul (aur beshak main ne aag dekhi, uska baaz baaz ko tod raha tha, aur main ne us mein Amr bin Luhayy ko dekha, aur wahi hai jis ne Saaeba (oontniyan) chhodein) key baad. (Bukhari: 1212)"
"629","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apni kisi haajat key liye bheja. To main gaya phir wapas aaya jabke main use poori kar chuka tha. To main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko salaam kya to Aap ne mujhey jawaab na diya. To merey dil mein wo pada jo Allah zyada jaanta hai. To main ne apne dil mein kaha: Shayad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujh par naaraaz huey ke main Aap key paas der se aaya. Phir main ne Aap ko salaam kya to Aap ne mujhey jawaab na diya. To merey dil mein pehli martaba se zyada pada. Phir main ne Aap ko salaam kya to Aap ne mujhey jawaab diya aur farmaya: Mujhey tumhey jawaab deney se sirf is ne roka ke main namaz padh raha tha. Aur Aap apni sawaari par they, qibley key siwa (rukh kar key). (Bukhari: 1217)"
"630","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke aadmi pehlu par haath rakh kar namaz padhey. (Bukhari: 1220). Sahw key sajdey ki kitaab."
